This model is based on RF-DETR-Seg Small, fine-tuned on institute-owned recordings
and on public images, and exported to FP16 ONNX with image resizing and
normalization in the graph. The export uses rfdetr 1.11.2. Its provenance and
tensor contract are recorded in model_manifest.yml shipped alongside the model.

Classes (taxonomy version 2): PEDESTRIAN, BICYCLE, MOTORCYCLE, CAR, UTILITY, BUS,
ANIMAL, VRU, MICRO, TRAFFIC_LIGHT, TRAFFIC_SIGN.

Training data

Labels for all training images were generated by ika with SAM 3; the public
datasets' own annotations were not used. The public images used are:

- COCO 2017 (https://cocodataset.org), Flickr images under CC BY 2.0 or
  "no known copyright restrictions"
- Open Images V7 (https://storage.googleapis.com/openimages/web/index.html),
  Flickr images under CC BY 2.0
- comma10k, comma.ai (https://github.com/commaai/comma10k), MIT
- EdgeVision, Gajjar et al., Mendeley Data, https://doi.org/10.17632/j82bnw7gsr.1,
  CC BY 4.0
- L-VAD, Kurniawan et al., Mendeley Data, https://doi.org/10.17632/h6p2w53my5.2,
  CC BY 4.0 (every 10th frame, resized)
- Sorokh-Poth, Hasan, Islam, Ahmad, Mendeley Data,
  https://doi.org/10.17632/7xvcvxgphb.1, CC BY 4.0
- S2TLD, Thinklab-SJTU (Xue Yang et al.), https://github.com/Thinklab-SJTU/S2TLD,
